==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Two Can]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Chief Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mighty Gui Zuli]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Chief Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Two Can]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Master Da Xun]]s spawn, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Master Da Xun]]s spawn, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring your usual anti-Red attackers such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] as well as a Wave Shield for the Two Can.

